---
// spec: S08, F18-AC7 (kya karte hain, documents, qeemat, sarkari fee ki wazahat, order, FAQ), F02-AC4; intent 13 (Ad: Nahin)
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import ProductCard from '../components/ProductCard.astro';
import TrustStrip from '../components/TrustStrip.astro';
import OrderSteps from '../components/OrderSteps.astro';
import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';
import seo from '../data/seo.json';
import { getProduct } from '../lib/catalog';

const meta = seo.pages['/apply-service'];
const product = getProduct('job-apply');
const docs = [
  'CNIC (dono taraf ki saaf tasveer)',
  'Matric, Inter aur aage ki degrees / transcripts',
  'Domicile',
  'Passport size tasveer',
  'Tajurbe ke certificate (agar post mangti ho)',
  'Ishtihar mein likhe doosre documents',
];
const faq = [
  {
    q: 'Sarkari fee kaun deta hai?',
    a: 'Aap. Sarkari fee official challan par jati hai aur hamari fee mein shamil nahin. GVS sarkari fee wapas nahin kar sakta; woh idare ke usool par hai.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Kya aap PPSC ya FPSC ki taraf se hain?',
    a: 'Nahin. GVS niji academy hai. Hum sirf aap ki taraf se online form bharne mein madad karte hain; faisla aur test idara khud leta hai.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Form bharne ke baad mujhe kya milega?',
    a: 'Form aur challan ki copy WhatsApp par, taake aap ke paas record rahe. Roll number slip aur test ki khabar idare ki website se aati hai.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Mere documents ka kya hota hai?',
    a: 'Documents sirf WhatsApp par, sirf usi form ke liye istemal hote hain, aur kaam ke baad hata diye jate hain. Portal par koi document upload nahin hota.',
  },
];
---
<Base title={meta.title} description={meta.description}>
  <div class="container-page py-6">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Career Desk', href: '/career' }, { label: 'Online apply service' }]} />
    <h1 class="mt-3">Online job apply service: hum form bhar dein</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted max-w-[68ch]">PPSC, FPSC, NTS aur doosre idaron ke online form hum bharte hain. Aap documents bhejein, hum baqi kaam karein.</p>

    <p class="mt-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-2 px-4 py-3 max-w-[68ch]">
      <strong>Zaroori:</strong> qeemat sirf hamari service fee hai. Sarkari fee alag hai aur official challan par jati hai.
      GVS niji academy hai, sarkari idara nahin.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px] lg:items-start">
      <div>
        <section aria-labelledby="docs-heading">
          <h2 id="docs-heading" class="mb-3">Aam taur par yeh documents chahiye</h2>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            {docs.map((d) => (
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-correct font-bold" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>{d}</span></li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Har post ke documents us ke official ishtihar mein likhe hote hain. Kisi job page se order karne par us post ki list khud aap ke message mein aati hai.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="my-8 max-w-[68ch]" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
          <h2 id="how-heading">Hum kya karte hain</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Sarkari job ka online form bharna lagta asaan hai, lekin is mein kai qadam hote hain: idare ki website par account banana,
            zaati maloomat, taleem aur tajurba bharna, tasveer aur documents sahih size mein upload karna, aur challan bana kar jama
            karwana. Kisi bhi qadam par ghalti ho to form rad ho sakta hai, aur aksar akhri tareekh guzar jane ke baad pata chalta hai.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Apply service mein aap order karte hain aur post ka naam batate hain. Payment aur documents milne ke baad hum aap ki taraf
            se form bharte hain, aap se tasdeeq karte hain, aur challan ki maloomat dete hain. Form aur challan ki copy WhatsApp par aap
            ke paas aati hai. Waqt payment aur documents dono milne ke baad shuru hota hai.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Akhri tareekh ke bilkul qareeb order na karein; idaron ki websites aakhri dinon mein aksar dheemi ho jati hain. Taza jobs
            aur un ki akhri tareekhein <a href="/jobs">Jobs</a> par dekhein, aur kisi post par "Hum apply kar dein" dabayein to us post
            ki documents ki list khud order mein aa jati hai.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Hum naukri ka wada nahin karte; selection idare ke test aur interview par hai. Test ki tayyari ke liye
            <a href="/job-prep">Job ki tayyari</a> aur CV ke liye <a href="/career/cv">CV service</a> dekhein.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      {product && (
        <aside aria-label="Order" class="lg:sticky lg:top-4">
          <ProductCard product={product} />
        </aside>
      )}
    </div>

    <TrustStrip />
    <OrderSteps />
    <FAQ items={faq} />
  </div>
</Base>
